Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar was the son of Mario Zeppeli,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.12,0:00:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,considered the best furniture\Nmaker in all of Naples.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mario was a proper Italian man of his\Nday, thoroughly dedicated to his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Caesar, he was the ideal man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Caesar was ten, Mario suddenly\Nleft without so much as a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having lost their mother\Nyears before, they were alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Distant relatives stole\Nwhat little they had.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar became a delinquent, growing to hate\Nhis father and what he had done to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's living carefree\Nwith some hot young woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fight him and then kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He threw away his youth and his future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He committed theft, arson, assault,\Nanything short of outright murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.62,0:00:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the local mafiosos feared him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.62,0:00:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're that guy\Nnamed Caesar, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's your last name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:00:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that means there's\Nno way you're Italian.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Italian are proud of their family names.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never holding back,
