Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.94,0:01:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though he didn't know it yet, he\Nwas already beginning to use Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, at age 16 in Rome...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that moment, Caesar felt he\Nmight murder his own father.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is all that?
