Dialogue: 2,0:01:39.70,0:01:39.75,SFXPurple,3,0,0,0,,{=41}{\bord0\blur1.1\alpha&HEB&\pos(1162.35,61.25)\frz0.7706\4a&HFF&}R{*\c&H702A61&}u{*\c&H652557&}m{*\c&H59214E&}b{*\c&H4E1C44&}l{\c&H42183A&}e
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.66,0:01:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a massive diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, don't touch that stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is the one doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Events had occurred 50 years ago that\Nwere completely unknown to Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.84,0:02:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His grandfather, Will, had died\Ntragically while on an expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mario took up his father's torch\Nand trained with Hamon to prepare,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,discovering the ruins soon after.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He began a worldwide search\Nfor a way to defeat the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.14,0:02:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monsters within and unlock\Nthe treasure they hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.02,0:02:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Caesar knew none of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young man, I beg from you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your way to Venice and\Nspeak with a woman named Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa, it's a matter of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.34,0:02:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is the only one who has\Nany chance of stopping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps because so many years\Nhad passed and Caesar had grown,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.20,0:02:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mario did not recognize his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar's father hadn't abandoned\Nhis family for selfish reasons.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.52,0:02:52.61,Main,Mario,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Hurry... hurry, you must go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd left in order to keep his children\Nsafe from the nightmare of the Pillar Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.27,0:03:30.73,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.27,0:03:30.73,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.36,0:03:34.57,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.36,0:03:34.57,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.57,0:03:37.95,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.57,0:03:37.95,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:03:37.95,0:03:45.20,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.95,0:03:45.20,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.96,0:03:51.75,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.96,0:03:51.75,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.96,0:03:51.75,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.24,0:03:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for love to call it a true love.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.75,0:04:00.47,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.75,0:04:00.47,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for a moment to call it a true.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.47,0:04:06.56,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.47,0:04:06.56,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love. I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.62,0:04:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to call
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.35,0:04:13.19,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.35,0:04:13.19,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.19,0:04:17.03,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.19,0:04:17.03,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're gonna get yasura no Seiko wo
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tuk Dario Knight omoi ga Mili no kira ko
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.03,0:04:22.45,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.03,0:04:22.45,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a burning stone. Atsuko\Nlike a burning stone. Ketsu Mega
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.29,0:04:25.54,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.29,0:04:25.54,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.79,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.79,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.79,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.79,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.79,0:04:31.63,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.79,0:04:31.63,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ni kizamareta yunan ni Uki\Nararu Granny hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.63,0:04:37.42,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.63,0:04:37.42,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.42,0:04:42.47,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.42,0:04:42.47,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nihiri shimete
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.89,0:04:52.36,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\pos(1155,865)\blur1}Episode 20: "Caesar's Lonely Youth" {Toni, Check that the title matches the preview at the end of 19 -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.89,0:04:52.36,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\pos(1155,865)}Episode 20: "Caesar's Lonely Youth" {Toni, Check that the title matches the preview at the end of 19 -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.84,0:04:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar's misunderstanding led to a\Ndeep hatred, but then that changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It became pride in his\Nfather and his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Caesar sought me out and picked\Nup where his father had left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going because he\Nneeds to avenge his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to speak\Nill of your brave family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you still want to go\Ncharging in there even
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.14,0:05:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though you know damn well\Nit's going to be a trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you must have figured\Nout some way to beat cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.12,0:05:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're going in that derelict\Nhellhole, then I'm right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar Zeppeli.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A set of footprints\Nleads into the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I saw someone there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I hallucinating?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not an illusion!
