Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.32,0:06:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seizure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know he's here. Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's within a few steps of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does Kars have some kind of new trick? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun is shining too strong for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't be out here and survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cat's stance, a\Nfundamental element of Kong fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar has never heard of Kong fu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but instinctively balances his\Nstance as he relaxes his limbs,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready for attack from any direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For him, it is not a\Ntechnique, but a reflex.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going in there all alone is madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay back, Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move at all,\Nlet alone go rushing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something is hiding just inside\Nthe entrance of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean I can't\Nsee a thing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A single footprint just appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have jumped!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming at us from above!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.22,0:06:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...?
