Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.86,0:07:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy was Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are he and Kars inside\Nthat mansion together?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can Wamuu come outside during the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did look kind of ghost-like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That infuriating, smart-talking upstart?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.36,0:07:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear tell that Jojo\Nhas learned quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is the man who killed Master AC/DC?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wam can control the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.68,0:07:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why he's difficult to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Air's coming from pipes in his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's only slightly\Nvisible because of water
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,vapor swirling in the\Nflow around his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's cloaking himself in vapor\Nthat he's generating from the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then he's pumping\Nit out of those pipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's refracting light,\Nlike a million tiny prisms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a suit that bends light around\Nhim, protecting him from the sun's rays.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thus allowing him to be outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why he seems to be transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad JoJo isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the bubble user\Nnamed Caesar, are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply by looking into your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see that you've also\Nlearned much through your ordeals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well. You are worthy of\Ndeath at my hands. Bubble user?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see who dies. I feel like I did\Nback then when I was naive and poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back when you viciously took the\Nlife of my father and now I'll use my
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:09:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,viciousness to destroy you very\Nimpressive but don't think your wind
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be able to just blow my bubbles\Naway some bubbles go right through a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've significantly updated my\Ngrandfather's Hamon Cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bubble Cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,High-speed rotation turns the\Nbubbles into a salvo of deadly discs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hamon ensures they\Nwon't pop along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind protecting you is nothing more\Nthan a pocket of empty air to them.
