Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I underestimated his skill with Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is far more than I bargained for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Hamon user! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gliding Bubble Cutter!
