Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:09:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you are tripped,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.92,0:10:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you try your best not to fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially if you need to avoid\Nsunlight in order to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Wamuu was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He bent over backwards and attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.40,0:10:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.92,0:10:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not just an immortal\Nwith incredible strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.64,0:10:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With senses like that,\Nhe's a fighting genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my bubble cutter must have\Ninflicted severe damage on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The advantage here is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a way to take\Nyou down, even indoors!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My nerves are home to a razor's edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel differences in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.76,0:11:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have the itch like when I was poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.62,0:11:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My breathing is relaxed and normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.34,0:11:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect Haman conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.90,0:11:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Machina!
