Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.78,0:11:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar and Machina aren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think they might\Nhave already gone inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's his.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.44,0:11:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Machina's arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.40,0:11:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avalanche!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bubble Cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:11:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Running?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't run or hide from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bubble Cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead, Wamuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.22,0:12:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Riding Bubble Cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finished with these games.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're through.
