Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.64,0:12:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine Sans!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Wamuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop and look around!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.12,0:12:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bubble cutters are now bubble lenses,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.24,0:12:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're floating in\Nthe air all around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:12:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that enormous hole you\Nknocked in the wall earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is just like the open shutter of a camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on a bright summer day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those lenses, they focus the sunlight...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into the hotel!
