Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.92,0:13:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're like a frozen image!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.98,0:13:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're totally exposed, Wamuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying your vapor barrier again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.76,0:13:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Wamuu, I'm going to finish you\Noff with a direct hormone blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One point, at one moment,\Na tiny blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar's body created the briefest of\Nshadows amid the blazing wall of sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu didn't waste his chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He showed Caesar once again\Nthat he was a fighting genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a genius of strategy! Wind power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine sandstorm!
