Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Wamuu's Divine\NSandstorm! I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that means Caesar is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had grown so much in so little time.\NI'm satisfied. I haven't had a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like that in ages now warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of Hamon and it was a close
