Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.32,0:14:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one as well if the wind of\Nmy divine sandstorm hadn't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.24,0:14:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had the strength to blow your\Nbubble senses to oblivion I
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.66,0:14:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have no idea how I would have\Nstopped the light before it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.28,0:14:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,destroyed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if the mighty Lord\NKars, who cannot use wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had been the one to first note your\Npresence and confront you as I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and faced your power,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if he had prevailed, he most certainly\Nwould have been in far worse shape?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than I find myself in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.90,0:15:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will not fight again, for you\Nhave nothing left with which to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My divine sandstorm has shredded your\Nbody beyond any chance of survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.42,0:15:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.50,0:15:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battle is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no more harmone\Nwith which to continue. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've almost completely bled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means you have no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.96,0:15:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life and all you once were has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lip rang with the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.06,0:16:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.21,0:16:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I am a proud member\Nof the Zeppeli family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.26,0:16:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you see, it's in my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something like this might mean absolutely
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing to a demented\Ninhuman monster like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father didn't recognize me, but he\Nsacrificed his life to save mine anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, my grandfather,
