Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.38,0:16:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gave his Ripple energy to save Jojo's\Ngrandfather right before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let my life's flame\Nsputter out to darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Zeppeli family spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,handed down from the past to\Nensure the family's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the human spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the last of my hormones!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.64,0:17:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.18,0:17:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounded like Caesar screaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I heard it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Caesar can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made a bubble from his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:18:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have used every last\Nbit of his Hamon to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before he died,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he saved it for his friends, rather\Nthan using it to try and destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let it go, but not because\NI'm sentimental about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His talent as a fighter was undeniable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has my deep respect\Nas a fellow warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will hold you in the last moments we\Nspent together forever in my memory, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.12,0:18:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man as splendid and as fleeting\Nas the bubbles he conjured.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.74,0:18:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The place is a wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A divine sandstorm did all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Caesar was caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:18:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right inside the heart of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.12,0:19:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.86,0:19:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside is Caesar's bandana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.04,0:19:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu's lip ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This hormone energy feels really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.94,0:19:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.85,0:19:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been able to\Nbring myself to call
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.08,0:19:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar's name since we made\Nour way into this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because I'm afraid\Nthere'll be no answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I came in here and cried out his name,\Nthere might not be any response in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There might be nothing\Nbut a lifeless silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.12,0:19:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is what scares me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:19:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't accept it, so\NI didn't call his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, I know he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Abbacchio in that bubble told\Nme everything I needed to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here, just a few\Nmoments ago, Caesar died.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.72,0:20:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had to be a damn show-off\Nright up until the very end!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.02,0:20:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then you leave a precious\Ngift like this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.46,0:20:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.80,0:20:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find you, Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pick you up! Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.77,0:20:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time to search or grieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have work to do. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are two of them and two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The numbers are balanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That trail of blood leading up the stairs
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.26,0:20:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tells me that Caesar\Nsignificantly wounded Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.18,0:20:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of enemy territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.68,0:20:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go and finish this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.70,0:20:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll go hunt those bastards down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That heartless...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't even manage to shed\Na single tear for Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.72,0:21:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coach Lisa Lisa, your cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.66,0:21:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa Lisa is our coach, so she\Nalways has to keep a cool exterior.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.02,0:21:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know she wants to cry,\Nmuch more than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.88,0:21:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He treated her like a goddess, and\Nknew her longer than I've known her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.42,0:21:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to try and hold my feelings back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, I know you always thought\NI was impulsive and self-centered
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But sometimes I do understand\Nthe feelings of those around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:21:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might finally be learning
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.90,0:22:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will fight them both\Nlike the devil until
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.80,0:22:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's nothing left of\Nthem I'll avenge you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.46,0:22:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar Your spirit is with me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.48,0:22:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.06,0:22:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.02,0:22:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where he fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.18,0:22:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.68,0:22:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.60,0:22:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were deep in enemy territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.78,0:22:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cars and Wamuu were very nearby, but\Nthe two simply couldn't help themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.86,0:22:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo called out Caesar's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.50,0:22:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa Lisa's tears flowed freely,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.56,0:23:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but their heartbroken cries of grief\Nwere answered only by a cold silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.76,0:23:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As they mourned him, they took\Nsolace in one simple fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though his body had died, his\Nsoul would live on through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.18,0:23:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace, Caesar Zeppeli.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.22,0:23:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In and around the lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.02,0:23:44.94,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.02,0:23:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:44.94,0:23:47.32,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.10,0:23:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They stand there.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.32,0:23:51.45,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,They stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.06,0:23:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,24 before my love!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.45,0:23:58.17,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Twenty four before my love and I'll be there
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.48,0:23:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:56.43,0:24:58.44,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\pos(960,700)\bord5.5\blur2}Next Episode
Dialogue: 1,0:24:56.43,0:24:58.44,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\pos(960,700)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.66,0:25:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really not impressing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.80,0:25:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to hug you to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.52,0:25:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fight tonight under the full moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.42,0:25:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.16,0:25:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll face this fight together, Caesar?
